[{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0027","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000139","title":"WordPress Infusionsoft 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 infusionsoft 插件 1.5.11 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，属于 CWE-79 类型。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的恶意 URL，诱使目标用户点击后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响使用该插件的所有 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。目前官方未发布修复补丁，建议禁用该插件或实施输入过滤与输出编码等安全措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000139"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 Infusionsoft Gravity Forms Add-on 升级至 1.5.12 或更高版本（该版本已修复 leadscoring.php 中 ContactId 参数的反射型 XSS 问题）。由于该插件已于 2021 年 10 月关闭且不再维护，建议停用并删除该插件，迁移至官方支持的 Infusionsoft 集成方案。如暂时无法替换，在 wp-config.php 中启用 DISALLOW_UNFILTERED_HTML 常量，并安装 Web 应用防火墙拦截恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93819","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=864","https://wordpress.org/plugins/infusionsoft","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000139.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000139.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000139.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000139.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000139-2699.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000139.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000139-5a043184256624a09d5739ac78a02adf.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000139.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Feb/09/Reports/xssReport.csv","https://github.com/florayfr1/Vulnerability-Exploitation-Predition/blob/87e8a915b8066d6456e2871889a8433ca92064c3/code/model/testing_set.csv","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000139-2700.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0026","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000138","title":"WordPress Indexisto 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 indexisto 1.0.5 版本存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（Reflected XSS）。攻击者无需认证即可通过构造特制的恶意 URL，诱使目标用户点击后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分过滤与转义，攻击条件简单，仅需用户交互即可触发。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000138"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"该插件已于 2014 年 3 月从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护，无法通过升级修复。建议立即卸载 Indexisto 1.0.5 插件，并替换为其他受支持的 WordPress 站内搜索插件（如 SearchWP、Relevanssi 等）。同时启用 WordPress 的 XSS 防护机制（如 Content-Security-Policy 头），并对用户输入进行严格的 HTML 编码转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93816","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=38","https://wordpress.org/plugins/indexisto","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000138.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000138.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000138.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-10