wordpress.org/plugins/hero-maps-pro","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000137.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000137.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000137.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000137.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2016-1000137-2693.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000137-2692.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-1000137/poc/nuclei/CVE-2016-1000137.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000137-530731e9ade233d4dbe4ad38b53d1129.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1000137_3.yaml","https://github.com/Dheia/sc-security-module/blob/26aa7559e395301460f54ab8fe974363473e619d/Imunify360%20Apache%20Ruleset/124_Extended_Rules.conf","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000137-2693.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0024","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000136","title":"WordPress heat-trackr 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"heat-trackr WordPress 插件 1.0 版本存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（Reflected XSS）。由于插件未对用户输入进行有效的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 参数注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本。当受害者点击该恶意链接后，脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。攻击无需身份认证，但需诱使用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000136"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:44Z","remediation":"立即卸载 heat-trackr 插件（该插件已于 2016 年 4 月从 WordPress 官方目录下架且不再维护），删除 /wp-content/plugins/heat-trackr/ 目录下的所有文件。同时将 WordPress 核心更新至最新版本，并安装 Web 应用防火墙插件（如 Wordfence）以拦截反射型 XSS 攻击。作为临时缓解措施，可在服务器端对 HTTP 请求中的 query 参数进行 HTML 实体编码输出过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93818","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=798","https://wordpress.org/plugins/heat-trackr","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000136.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000136.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000136.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000136.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000136-2687.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000136.js","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000136-2687.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000136-2689.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000136-743a0575c2e9f5674d434b647e0829cf.yaml","https://github.com/nirsarkar/scan4all/blob/8d5043f57e3e3247b7094fdc1f6eeba7180a64a1/config/nuclei-templates/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000136.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0023","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000135","title":"WordPress hdw-tube 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"hdw-tube WordPress 插件 1.2 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79），由于对用户输入参数缺乏有效的过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱使用户点击，导致恶意脚本在受害者浏览器中执行，造成信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需用户交互，无需身份认证，影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000135"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:44Z","remediation":"该插件已停止维护，建议立即从 WordPress 后台插件管理中删除 hdw-tube 插件，或手动删除 /wp-content/plugins/hdw-tube/ 目录。如仍需视频功能，可替换为受支持的替代插件（如 YouTube Embed 等）。同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含恶意脚本参数的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93820","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=533","https://wordpress.org/plugins/hdw-tube","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000135.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000135.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000135.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000135.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000135.js","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000135-2683.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000135-2684.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-1000135/poc/nuclei/CVE-2016-1000135.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2016/CVE-2016-1000135-hdw_tube-1c5d214e-65e2-4158-a88f-58bef7c9952b.yaml","https://github.com/MinhChau137/GraphPent/blob/7d0ca5fa11df5edbedc9801b6bcaac30d17f47cb/data/cvelistV5-main/cvelistV5-main/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000135.json","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/cve/CVE-2016-1000135-2684.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0021","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000134","title":"WordPress hdw-tube 插件 1.2 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"hdw-tube WordPress 插件 1.2 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理。攻击者可利用该漏洞构造特制的恶意 URL，诱使已登录管理员或普通用户点击，从而在目标浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，实现窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起其他恶意操作。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互，影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000134"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:44Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台停用并彻底删除 hdw-tube 插件（该插件已于 2016 年 4 月关闭下架，不再维护）。如仍需视频功能，请替换为其他仍在维护的视频库插件。若无法立即删除，可在主题 functions.php 中添加 add_filter('the_content', 'esc_html') 对输出内容转义，并配置 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制内联脚本执行作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93868","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=530","https://wordpress.org/plugins/hdw-tube","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000134.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000134.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000134.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000134.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000134.js","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000134-2676.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1000134-2676.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000134-2676.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2016-1000134_8.yaml","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs%20&%20POCs/2016/CVE-2016-1000134.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0020","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000133","title":"WordPress forget-about-shortcode-buttons 插件 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"forget-about-shortcode-buttons WordPress 插件 1.1.1 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79）。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意 URL 参数注入任意 JavaScript 代码，当目标用户点击该特制链接时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 WordPress 环境下使用该插件的所有站点，攻击条件仅需诱导用户点击恶意链接，利用难度较低。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000133"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:44Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 Forget About Shortcode Buttons 升级至 1.1.2 或更高版本（1.1.2 为安全更新，修复了反射型 XSS 漏洞）。如无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则过滤包含 `<script>` 等恶意标签的 URL 查询参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93869","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=602","https://wordpress.org/plugins/forget-about-shortcode-buttons","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000133.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000133.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000133.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000133.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000133.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000133_5.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2016-1000133-2674.yaml","https://github.com/cyb3r-w0lf/nuclei-template-collection/blob/7025ebe04ab60b84aee0af1ecf4f90601332e8e7/nuclei-templates/CVE-2016/cve-2016-1000133.yaml","https://github.com/w8mej/WAFRulesHeuristics/blob/561418df576934335fdaf71c0271230e024c5d70/comodo_rules/categories.conf","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000133-2675.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0019","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000132","title":"WordPress enhanced-tooltipglossary 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 enhanced-tooltipglossary 3.2.8 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（Reflected XSS）漏洞，属于 CWE-79 类型。攻击者无需身份认证，通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 诱使用户点击，即可在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取 Cookie、会话令牌或重定向至恶意网站。该漏洞影响 WordPress enhanced-tooltipglossary 插件的 3.2.8 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000132"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:44Z","remediation":"立即将 CM Tooltip Glossary 插件升级至 4.3.8 及以上版本（推荐升级至最新版 4.5.5），在 WordPress 后台插件页面直接更新即可。如无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 `glossary_tooltip` 短码相关参数进行输入过滤和输出转义，拦截包含 `<script>` 等恶意标签的请求。同时建议对所有用户输入启用 WordPress 内置的 `esc_html()` 和 `esc_attr()` 转义函数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93865","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=37","https://wordpress.org/plugins/enhanced-tooltipglossary","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000132.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000132.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000132.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000132.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000132-2666.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000132.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000132-2667.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a7af5a678b55af1e4884963bdb9ea6fae03d5b34/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-10001xx/CVE-2016-1000132.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2016-1000132-2667_1.yaml","https://git