rences":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93892","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=449","https://wordpress.org/plugins/defa-online-image-protector","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000129.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000129.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000129-2653.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000129_38.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2016-1000129_2.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2016-1000129-2654.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/03/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/rishikesh-j/Nuclei-Templates-Scrapped/blob/c1c4a009b3ada12b7923dcbc40e099ce8f224b2c/templates/CVE-2016-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0015","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000128","title":"WordPress anti-plagiarism 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 反抄袭（anti-plagiarism）插件 3.60 版本存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 参数，诱使目标用户点击恶意链接，导致恶意 JavaScript 代码在用户浏览器中执行，从而窃取会话凭证、劫持用户会话或实施钓鱼攻击。攻击条件仅需用户交互（点击链接），无需任何认证，影响运行该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000128"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:43Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 WordPress 插件 anti-plagiarism 3.60 及所有更早版本，该插件已自 2010 年起关闭且不再维护。安装替代的原创检测插件（如 Plagiarism Checker 或 CopyDetect）。同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含 `<script>` 等恶意标签的 URL 查询参数，作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93890","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=161","https://wordpress.org/plugins/anti-plagiarism","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000128.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000128.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000128.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000128.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2016/CVE-2016-1000128-anti_plagiarism-bb6ecb74-b337-4930-a737-f70799607d89.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000128-2648.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-1000128/poc/nuclei/CVE-2016-1000128.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000128-2649.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2016-1000128.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-1000128.rules","https://github.com/thetowsif/nuclei-template-fetcher/blob/a976ca2f195df8cbbe200182ad03f933a578bb92/community-templates/templates/cve-2016-1000128-2650.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0014","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000127","title":"WordPress ajax-random-post 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress ajax-random-post 插件 2.00 版本存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（Reflected XSS），攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入目标页面，当受害者点击该链接时，恶意脚本在浏览器中执行，导致攻击者窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或重定向至钓鱼页面。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，但需要用户交互（点击链接）。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。建议升级插件至最新版本或禁用该插件以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000127"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:43Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 ajax-random-post 插件 2.00 版本，该插件已停止维护且不再更新。建议使用其他经过安全审计的随机文章展示插件替代，如 WordPress 官方推荐的 Random Posts 插件。同时启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截常见的反射型 XSS 攻击载荷，并对用户输入参数进行严格的 HTML 实体编码输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93895","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=494","https://wordpress.org/plugins/ajax-random-post","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000127.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000127.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000127.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000127.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000127-2647.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000127.js","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000127-2644.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000127-ajax_random_post-0bb13936-cbc0-4cba-bd62-ef6d9728a65a.yaml","https://github.com/xerocorps/TFnuclei-templates/blob/d245eff8cac0c4c045abb6b87a2692c247f564bc/templates/CVE-2016-1000127-5d15dee6dbe4e10317fdcb5b87ac684a.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2016-1000127-2646.yaml","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0013","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000126","title":"WordPress admin-font-editor Plugin 反射跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 admin-font-editor 插件 1.8 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（Reflected XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的特制 URL，诱使目标用户点击后，恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行，导致攻击者能够窃取会话 Cookie、重定向页面或篡改页面内容。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，但需要用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。建议升级插件至最新版本或移除该插件以修复漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000126"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:43Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台插件管理中停用并删除 admin-font-editor 插件（版本 1.8 及更早版本均受影响）。由于该插件已永久关闭且不再更新，无可用补丁，彻底删除是唯一修复方案。如仍需管理后台字体，可选用仍在维护的替代插件如 \"Use Any Font\" 或 \"Custom Fonts\"。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93896","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=526","https://wordpress.org/plugins/admin-font-editor","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000126.yaml","https: