Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-6415"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-09-19T01:59:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:50:59Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 15.6(1)T 及以上版本，或升级 IOS XE 至 3.19S 及以上版本，或升级 IOS XR 至 5.3.0 及以上版本。对于 PIX 设备，升级至 7.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在受影响设备的 IKEv1 配置中禁用 Security Association 协商功能，或在边界防火墙上限制 UDP 500/4500 端口的入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20160916-ikev1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93003","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036841","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-6415","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43383","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-6415.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-6415.json","https://github.com/nixawk/labs/blob/ce800ddc00a8bbf716afe754a1e81e58570b8c50/CVE-2016-6415/README.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2016-6415.html.txt","https://github.com/1N3/Sn1per/blob/a5450bc496a1af04f8368888f86d086a9fc046b8/modes/normal.sh","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-6415","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2016/6xxx/CVE-2016-6415.json","https://github.com/stamparm/maltrail/blob/32a2eaa81c9098d6c262e9373773b78c473ddacc/trails/static/malicious/bad_script.txt","https://github.com/reddelexc/hackerone-reports/blob/420e41078cd65f59f446c2dc4b337051e83055bc/docs/tops_by_program/TOPMAILRU.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-6415.txt","https://github.com/3ndG4me/CVE-2016-6415-BenignC